# Generated by `pnpm pipeline` — deterministic from the pinned source + hash.
# Regenerate rather than commit; a stale committed artifact is a silent bug.
data/build/

# Generated reviewer packet: contains full verse text in all three editions.
# It is produced on demand by pipeline/tools/review-packet.ts and sent to the
# reviewer; the public repo ships the protocol (docs/blind-set.md), not this.
docs/blind-review.md

